tasks.prompt:
Open a free SQL playground in your browser (for example sqliteonline.com, which also works on a phone). Run:
CREATE TABLE payments(payment_id INT, user_id INT, method TEXT, amount INT, paid_at TEXT);
INSERT INTO payments VALUES (1,11,'UPI',450,'2026-04-02 10:15'),(2,12,'Card',2300,'2026-04-05 18:40'),(3,11,'UPI',120,'2026-04-30 21:05'),(4,13,'Wallet',800,'2026-04-18 09:00'),(5,14,'UPI',999,'2026-05-01 08:30'),(6,12,'Card',1500,'2026-03-31 23:50');
Then write a query that shows, for each payment method, the number of payments and the total amount in April 2026, largest total first. Paste the result. (About 35 minutes.)
